  'high',
  'Included for Australian women-led early-stage VC matching: Scale Investors was founded in 2013 as a gender-lens syndicate and launched Scale Venture Fund 1 in 2025 as Australia''s first all-women-led VC fund investing in women-led tech startups. The official Fund 1 mandate requires at least one woman or gender non-conforming co-founder with equal equity and C-suite decision-making power, and focuses on high-growth tech, early-stage women-led companies. Official stage focus is Pre-Seed and Seed, with follow-on Series A co-investment; Series A should not be treated as ordinary new lead matching. Official focus areas are Care, Climate Tech and Consumer Tech, with strong interest in AI-driven startups where AI is the core engine of innovation. recent_deals include Oli/Baymatob A$6.5m Series A3 backed by Scale, Clean Slate Clinic''s A$4.3m structured raise where Scale increased backing, and Proseek Bio''s A$1.5m oversubscribed seed round with Scale participating. cheque_ranges are official Fund 1 terms, but the pre-seed max is interpreted conservatively as A$500k because the webpage text appears to render ambiguously as $5000k; review before using as a hard cheque filter. founder_fit includes global_ambition because Scale screens for high-growth tech, large-market and exit-potential companies; this requires controlled vocabulary support. lead_behavior = lead because Scale states it aims to lead at pre-seed and seed and Oli/Baymatob provides in-window lead evidence. screening_priority is high because the fund is actively deploying in 2026 and has clear official mandate, cheque guidance and named in-window investments.'
