Pre-seed","amount_text":"$1m","amount_value":1000000,"amount_currency":null,"role":"Participant","investor_evidence_url":"https://www.startupdaily.net/topic/funding/employee-retention-startup-raises-1-million-pre-seed-round/"}]$json$::jsonb,
